.TH "whipper-cd-info" "1" "2020" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
whipper-cd-info \- Retrieve information about the currently inserted CD
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.nf
whipper cd info [\fB\-R\fP \fI<RELEASE_ID>\fP] [\fB\-p\fP] [\fB\-c\fP \fI<COUNTRY>\fP]
whipper cd info \fB\-h\fP
.fi
.sp
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.nf
\fB\-h\fP | \fB\-\-help\fP
.in +2
Show this help message and exit
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.nf
\fB\-R\fP \fI<RELEASE_ID>\fP | \fB\-\-release\-id\fP \fI<RELEASE_ID>\fP
.in +2
MusicBrainz release id to match to (if there are multiple)
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.nf
\fB\-p\fP | \fB\-\-prompt\fP
.in +2
Prompt if there are multiple matching releases
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.nf
\fB\-c\fP \fI<COUNTRY>\fP | \fB\-\-country\fP \fI<COUNTRY>\fP
.in +2
Filter releases by country
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
whipper(1), whipper\-cd(1), whipper\-cd\-rip(1)
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Louis-Philippe Véronneau
